# Placeholder/documentation only - the real caddy/users.caddyfile (gitignored)
# is generated automatically in production by terraform/bootstrap-caddy.sh
# from the CADDY_BASICAUTH_CREDENTIALS GitHub secret (plaintext
# "name:password" lines, hashed on the droplet at boot - never hand-written).
#
# For local testing (COMPOSE_PROFILES=caddy locally), copy this file to
# caddy/users.caddyfile and add real bcrypt hashes, one "name hash" pair per
# line, generated via:
#   docker run --rm caddy:2-alpine caddy hash-password --plaintext 'your-password'
#
# name $2a$14$examplehashgoeshere
